hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"956","'Abdullah ibn as-Samit said"
"957","'Ali reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"958","Abu Razin said about Abu Hurayra"
"959","Abu'l-'Aliyya al-Bara' said"
"960","It is related that 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar reported that 'Umar went\nwith the Messenger of Allah"
"961","Jabir said"
"962","Jabir said"
"963","He also said"
"964","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"965","'Utayy ibn Damura said"
"966","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn Sa'd said"
"967","It is related that Abu Musa was with the Prophet"
"968","Salama ibn Wardan said"
